techniques (model files in standard formats, standard neural-network
runtimes). It does not contain cryptographic code beyond what is
required for the platform's standard TLS / certificate validation,
and it does not contain any controlled-technology items under
the U.S. EAR or equivalent regulations.

If you are a user in a jurisdiction that restricts the import or use
of accessibility or speech-recognition software, you are responsible
for determining the legality of your use.

